{%- comment -%}
  tonelight-ks-landing
  --------------------
  Code-first, dark landing page for the toneLight Kickstarter campaign.
  Rendered via templates/page.tonelight-ks-promo.liquid using layout/tonelight-ks.liquid.

  CONVENTIONS: same system as the tonescan landing page.
  - Tailwind v4, prefix-first (tw:). Dark theme, blue accent #3b82f6 / #60a5fa, minimal 2px radius.
  - Container: max-w-[1400px], px-[15px] md:px-[50px]. Arbitrary px for type/spacing.
  - Keeps the hero copy from the old KS page; campaign video is a placeholder.
  - The waitlist form is the existing snippet (rendered as-is).

  BUILD ORDER (stubs below): 1 hero+countdown  2 marquee  3 why-RGB/crosstalk
    4 the system (toneLight/toneCarrier/toneStudio)  5 benefits bento  6 how it works
    7 team  8 rewards/tiers  9 faq  10 waitlist CTA
{%- endcomment -%}

