        <p class="tw:mt-[18px] tw:text-[17px] tw:leading-[1.65] tw:text-neutral-400">toneScan Studio drives the light and carrier, then automatically combines and inverts your scans with an engine built on real film physics. Point it at a hot folder and scans appear, merge and invert as they land — batch-edit and export a full roll in minutes.</p>
        <p class="tw:mt-[16px] tw:text-[15px] tw:text-neutral-500">Every backer gets a lifetime toneScan Studio licence, free.</p>
        <a href="/pages/tonescan-landing" class="tw:mt-[24px] tw:inline-flex tw:items-center tw:gap-[8px] tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-[#60a5fa] tw:transition-colors tw:hover:text-white">
