        <p class="tw:mb-[16px] tw:text-[13px] tw:font-semibold tw:uppercase tw:tracking-[0.16em] tw:text-[#60a5fa]">Rewards</p>
        <h2 class="tw:text-[32px] tw:font-semibold tw:leading-[1.1] tw:tracking-[-0.02em] tw:text-white tw:md:text-[46px]">Back it at launch, save the most.</h2>
        <p class="tw:mx-auto tw:mt-[16px] tw:max-w-[560px] tw:text-[16px] tw:text-neutral-400">Early-bird tiers are limited and go live on launch day. Most people already camera-scan — if that's you, the light is the only part you're missing. You'll need a copy stand or sturdy tripod to mount your camera.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tw:mt-[48px] tw:grid tw:grid-cols-1 tw:gap-[20px] tw:md:grid-cols-2 tw:xlg:grid-cols-4">

        <div class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:rounded-[2px] tw:border tw:border-white/10 tw:bg-white/[0.02] tw:p-[28px]">
